#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:1 docs/features/companion.md:11
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:598
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/companion.md:1 docs/features/companion.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop Companion"
msgstr "桌面伴侣"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Dynamic SAP satellite**: a standalone desktop GUI app, not managed via `config.yaml`.\n"
msgstr "> **动态 SAP 卫星**：独立的桌面 GUI 应用，不通过 `config.yaml` 管理。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:10
msgid ""
"The desktop companion is a SAP **Type B** app (embedded sidecar holds the "
"Habitat WebSocket, `relay: false`): the **content pack** (React + VRM + Node "
"sidecar) is embedded by the **desktop shell** (`src/app/shell/desktop`), "
"registers with the Habitat via SAP, and exposes local tools to the Agent."
msgstr ""
"桌面伴侣是 SAP **Type B** 应用（嵌入式 sidecar 持有 Habitat WebSocket，`relay: "
"false`）：**内容包**（React + VRM + Node sidecar）由 **桌面壳层**（`src/app/"
"shell/desktop`）嵌入，通过 SAP 向 Habitat 注册，并向 Agent 暴露本地工具。"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/companion.md:13
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "FreeAnima Desktop (src/app/shell/desktop)\n"
#| "├── Electron Main — tray / multi-window + embedded companion sidecar\n"
#| "│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
#| "│   ├── companion settings — settings window\n"
#| "│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
#| "│   └── console — Habitat WebView (Habitat REST)\n"
#| "└── Renderer — preload satelliteShell; companion API via localhost sidecar\n"
#| "         ↕ SAP WS\n"
#| "    anima service Habitat\n"
msgid ""
"FreeAnima Desktop (src/app/shell/desktop)\n"
"├── Electron Main — tray / multi-window + embedded companion sidecar\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings window (Habitat RPC + asset HTTP)\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
"│   └── console — Habitat WebView (Habitat REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — preload satelliteShell; companion visibility via IPC\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS + Habitat RPC\n"
"    anima service Habitat (companion_profile SSOT + assets + FBX→VRMA)\n"
msgstr ""
"FreeAnima Desktop (src/app/shell/desktop)\n"
"├── Electron Main — tray / multi-window + embedded companion sidecar\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings window\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
"│   └── console — Habitat WebView (Habitat REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — preload satelliteShell; companion API via localhost sidecar\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS\n"
"    anima service Habitat\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:25
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Trust boundary"
msgid "Habitat vs local boundary"
msgstr "信任边界"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:33
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Attribute  | Value                                                                                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Trigger    | Sleep-cycle step `deep-sleep` (after light-sleep in DAG)                                                                                              |\n"
#| "| Target     | All active semantic memory                                                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| Operations | Contradiction detection + expiry marking, split, dedup merge, pin quality review—four sequential rounds                                               |\n"
#| "| Mode       | **Incremental** (scheduled Tue–Sun): skip quiet rounds when nothing was `updated` in 24h; **Full** (scheduled Mon + manual): all rounds on full store |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer            | Location                             | Responsibility                                                                                                                                                           |\n"
"| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| **Habitat SSOT**     | `src/features/companion/`            | `companion_profile` entity (behavior, slots, library meta); VRM/VRMA files under `~/.anima/companion/` on Habitat host; FBX→VRMA conversion; Settings read/write via Habitat RPC |\n"
"| **Settings UI**  | Desktop Settings → Companion section | Habitat RPC (`companion.config.*`, model/motion CRUD); upload via `POST /rpc/v1/companion/model/upload` and `/companion/motion/import`                                   |\n"
"| **Thin sidecar** | `src/satellites/companion/server/`   | SAP attach, `bubble` / `play_slot`, runtime WebSocket, local asset cache; startup `companion.sync.pull`                                                                  |\n"
"| **Electron**     | `src/app/shell/desktop/`             | Transparent window, click-through, tray, companion show/hide IPC                                                                                                         |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 属性  | 值                                                                                                |\n"
"| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 触发    | sleep-cycle 步骤 `deep-sleep`（DAG 中在 light-sleep 之后）                                             |\n"
"| 目标     | 全部 active 语义记忆                                                                           |\n"
"| 操作 | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记、拆分、去重合并、置顶维护——四轮顺序执行 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:35
msgid ""
"Management is in **Settings only** — Habitat has no companion admin page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:37
msgid ""
"On sidecar start: Habitat config wins; `~/.anima/companion/config.json` on the "
"desktop is an **offline cache**. Legacy local data is migrated once to Habitat "
"(`companion.migrate.fromLocal` or HTTP upload). Multiple desktops share the "
"same model/motion library via Habitat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/companion.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Settings ──Habitat RPC/HTTP──► features/companion (Habitat)\n"
"Sidecar  ◄──sync.pull────► Habitat          ──► local cache (VRM/VRMA)\n"
"Overlay  ◄──localhost────► Sidecar       (runtime WS + /api/config)\n"
"Electron ◄──IPC──────────► Settings       (show/hide only)\n"
"Agent    ──SAP───────────► Sidecar        (bubble, play_slot)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:47
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
