#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:49
msgid "Compared with Chat / pair programming:"
msgstr "与聊天室 / 结对编程对比："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|             | Chat / pair programming              | Companion                                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| UI          | Browser Web UI                       | Native transparent companion window + settings       |\n"
"| Deployment  | Managed (can co-locate with service) | Dynamic (user starts manually)                       |\n"
"| SAP         | Type A or Type B + relay             | Type B + tools, no relay                             |\n"
"| Client & UI | Can be separated                     | Companion render and settings share one Electron app |\n"
msgstr ""
"|             | 聊天室 / 结对编程        | 伴侣                                         |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| UI          | 浏览器 Web UI                 | 原生透明伴侣窗口 + 设置    |\n"
"| 部署  | 托管（可与 service 同机部署） | 动态（用户手动启动）                |\n"
"| SAP         | Type A 或 Type B + relay       | Type B + 工具，无 relay                          |\n"
"| 客户端与 UI | 可分离               | 伴侣渲染与设置共用同一 Electron 应用 |\n"

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/features/companion.md:57 messages/po4a/en.xml:603
#, no-wrap
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"VRM avatar rendering (Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`); VRM 1.0 and 0.x auto "
"orientation correction"
msgstr ""
"VRM 形象渲染（Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`）；VRM 1.0 与 0.x 自动朝向校正"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"**Motion slots**: five slots — `idle`, `rest`, `walk`, `climb`, `in_place`; "
"each slot binds 0..n VRMA clips; play by id or random; empty slot = no "
"animation"
msgstr ""
"**动作槽位**：五个槽位 — `idle`、`rest`、`walk`、`climb`、`in_place`；每槽绑"
"定 0..n 个 VRMA 片段；按 id 或随机播放；空槽 = 无动画"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"**Speech bubble**: one-way text queue; user click advances; no auto-dismiss; "
"pushed by Habitat Agent via `companion.bubble` tool"
msgstr ""
"**语音气泡**：单向文本队列；用户点击推进；不自动消失；由 Habitat Agent 通过 "
"`companion.bubble` 工具推送"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"Transparent always-on-top companion window (160×260); avatar area clickable, "
"empty area click-through"
msgstr "透明置顶伴侣窗口（160×260）；形象区域可点击，空白区域点击穿透"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"**Local interaction**: drag to move window; click body to play random motion "
"from `in_place` slot"
msgstr "**本地交互**：拖拽移动窗口；点击身体从 `in_place` 槽随机播放动作"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"**Patrol** (Settings → Behavior tab): idle patrol, double-click patrol, "
"corner pause, patrol speed, return-to-start on launch, etc."
msgstr ""
"**巡逻**（设置 → 行为标签页）：空闲巡逻、双击巡逻、角落暂停、巡逻速度、启动时"
"回到起点等"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"System tray: show/hide companion, **Settings…** (open settings window), quit"
msgstr "系统托盘：显示/隐藏伴侣、**设置…**（打开设置窗口）、退出"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"Settings tabs: **General** / **Behavior** / **Models** / **Motion slots** / "
"**Motion library**"
msgstr "设置标签页：**常规** / **行为** / **模型** / **动作槽位** / **动作库**"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent tools (sidecar registration)"
msgstr "Agent 工具（sidecar 注册）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool        | Parameters                           | Description                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | Enqueue text in speech bubble          |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`; `motion_id?: string` | Play motion slot; `motion_id` optional |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 工具        | 参数                           | 说明                          |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | 在语音气泡中排队文本        |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`；`motion_id?: string` | 播放动作槽位；`motion_id` 可选 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:76
msgid ""
"Periodic content (e.g. scheduled jokes) is configured on **anima service / "
"scheduled tasks**; the Agent calls `bubble`. Companion has no built-in timer."
msgstr ""
"周期性内容（如定时笑话）在 **anima service / 定时任务** 中配置；Agent 调用 "
"`bubble`。伴侣无内置定时器。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Models and motions"
msgstr "模型与动作"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:80
msgid ""
"The repo **does not bundle** `.vrm` / `.vrma` files. **Habitat** is the SSOT: "
"`companion_profile` entity in PostgreSQL plus files on the Habitat host at "
"`~/.anima/companion/models/` and `motions/`. Each desktop keeps a **local "
"cache** synced on sidecar start (`companion.sync.pull`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRM models"
msgstr "VRM 模型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:84
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Settings → **Models** tab: list, import, delete, rename, switch current "
#| "model. Files saved to `~/.anima/companion/models/`."
msgid ""
"Settings → **Models** tab: list, import, delete, rename, switch current "
"model. Upload goes to Habitat (`POST /rpc/v1/companion/model/upload`); "
"sidecar downloads missing files for overlay rendering."
msgstr ""
"设置 → **模型**标签页：列表、导入、删除、重命名、切换当前模型。文件保存至 "
"`~/.anima/companion/models/`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:86
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "During development, files in `satellites/companion/public/models/` serve "
#| "as fallback."
msgid ""
"During development, files in `src/satellites/companion/public/models/` serve "
"as fallback."
msgstr "开发期间，`satellites/companion/public/models/` 中的文件作为回退。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRMA library and slots"
msgstr "VRMA 库与槽位"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:90
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Settings → **Motion library** tab: import VRMA ZIP or single files; "
#| "**Motion slots** tab: assign motions per slot. Preview supports mouse "
#| "drag to rotate view."
msgid ""
"Settings → **Motion library** tab: import VRMA, FBX, or ZIP (FBX is "
"converted on **Habitat**, not on desktop). **Motion slots** tab assigns motions "
"per slot. Preview supports mouse drag to rotate view."
msgstr ""
"设置 → **动作库**标签页：导入 VRMA ZIP 或单文件；**动作槽位**标签页：为各槽分"
"配动作。预览支持鼠标拖拽旋转视角。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:92
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Motion files: `~/.anima/companion/motions/`. Unbound slots play no "
#| "animation; patrol still moves the window; walk/climb VRMA play only when "
#| "bound."
msgid ""
"Unbound slots play no animation; patrol still moves the window; walk/climb "
"VRMA play only when bound."
msgstr ""
"动作文件：`~/.anima/companion/motions/`。未绑定槽位不播放动画；巡逻仍会移动窗"
"口；walk/climb VRMA 仅在绑定后播放。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "FBX import"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:96
msgid ""
"FBX→VRMA runs on the **Habitat host** (`anima service`). Desktop installers no "
"longer bundle `fbx2vrma-converter` or FBX2glTF. On the Habitat machine run `bun "
"run setup:fbx` if FBX conversion is needed."
msgstr ""

